{"files":[{"content":"#include <algorithm>\n#include <cassert>\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <limits>\n#include <vector>\n\nint main() {\n    int n, s;\n    std::cin >> n >> s;\n    std::vector<std::vector<int>> matrix(n, std::vector<int>(n));\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; ++j) {\n            scanf(\"%d\", &matrix[i][j]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    assert(s < n);\n    assert(n < 8000);\n    assert(s > 0);\n    assert(n > 0);\n\n    long long mxSum;\n    if (s <= 2) {\n        long long sum = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < s; ++i) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < s; ++j) {\n                sum += matrix[i][j];\n            }\n        }\n        mxSum = sum;\n\n        int dir = 1;\n        int i = 0;\n        int j = 0;\n        while (i + s <= n) {\n            if ((j + s == n && dir == 1) || (j == 0 && dir == -1)) {\n                int exitingRow = i;\n                int enteringRow = exitingRow + s;\n                if (enteringRow >= n) break;\n\n                #pragma omp simd reduction(+:sum)\n                for (int k = 0; k < s; ++k) {\n                    sum += static_cast<long long>(matrix[enteringRow][k + j]) -\n                           matrix[exitingRow][k + j];\n                }\n\n                ++i;\n                dir *= -1;\n            } else {\n                int exitingCol, enteringCol;\n                if (dir == 1) {\n                    exitingCol = j;\n                    enteringCol = exitingCol + s;\n                } else {\n                    enteringCol = j - 1;\n                    exitingCol = enteringCol + s;\n                }\n\n                for (int k = 0; k < s; ++k) {\n                    sum += static_cast<long long>(matrix[k + i][enteringCol]) -\n                           matrix[k + i][exitingCol];\n                }\n                j += dir;\n            }\n            mxSum = std::max(mxSum, sum);\n        }\n    } else {\n        std::vector<long long> columnBand(n, 0);\n        std::vector<long long> horizontalPrefix(n + 1, 0);\n        for (int r = 0; r < s; ++r) {\n            #pragma omp simd\n            for (int c = 0; c < n; ++c) {\n                columnBand[c] += matrix[r][c];\n            }\n        }\n\n        mxSum = std::numeric_limits<long long>::lowest();\n        for (int top = 0; top + s <= n; ++top) {\n            horizontalPrefix[0] = 0;\n            for (int c = 0; c < n; ++c) {\n                horizontalPrefix[c + 1] = horizontalPrefix[c] + columnBand[c];\n            }\n\n            long long rowMax = std::numeric_limits<long long>::lowest();\n            #pragma omp simd reduction(max:rowMax)\n            for (int left = 0; left + s <= n; ++left) {\n                const long long sum = horizontalPrefix[left + s] - horizontalPrefix[left];\n                if (sum > rowMax) rowMax = sum;\n            }\n            mxSum = std::max(mxSum, rowMax);\n\n            if (top + s < n) {\n                const std::vector<int>& exitingRow = matrix[top];\n                const std::vector<int>& enteringRow = matrix[top + s];\n                #pragma omp simd\n                for (int c = 0; c < n; ++c) {\n                    columnBand[c] += static_cast<long long>(enteringRow[c]) -\n                                     exitingRow[c];\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%lld\\n\", mxSum);\n    return 0;\n}\n","path":"src/solution.cpp"}],"hypothesis":"For S > 2, replacing the loop-carried horizontal sliding-sum recurrence with prefix-sum differences makes each window sum independent, enabling SIMD max reduction across window positions. The extra prefix pass may trade off against removing the recurrence dependency.","notes":"This is an unmeasured candidate. Prefix values and window sums use long long; no inputs or output behavior are specialized.","research":{"queries":[],"urls":[]},"sources_kept":[],"transformations":["For each vertical column band, build a horizontal prefix array and evaluate each S-wide window as a difference of two prefix entries.","Use an OpenMP SIMD max reduction over independent horizontal window sums; retain the existing vertical-band update and S <= 2 path."]}